<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Applebee's cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Applebee's cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown analyst David Trossman said he downgraded Applebee's International Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- cited strong stock price, and negative same-store sales of company-owned stores in the second quarter.</p>
<p>-- said kept earnings estimates at $1.61 per share for 1997, and $1.95 for 1998.</p>
</text>
